"This PE class is learning how to use the balance beam. A balance beam is nothing more than long square pole that runs horizontally above the ground. Young gymnasts who are just learning use a beam that is only a foot or two off the ground. Competitive gymnasts are required to use a beam that it much higher. Regardless of its height, it still takes a lot of practice to maintain your balance on the narrow apparatus.": "9c99d7a381a2",
"This PE class is learning how to use the balance beam. A balance beam is nothing more than long square pole that runs horizontally above the ground. Young gymnasts who are just learning use a beam that is only a foot or two off the ground. Competitive gymnasts are required to use a beam that it much higher. Regardless of its height, it still takes a lot of practice to maintain your balance on the narrow apparatus. In gymnastic competitions, such as the Olympics, gymnasts perform choreographed routines on the balance beam. Scores are calculated by several judges according to degree of difficulty, artistic merit and execution of the routine. This means that the more difficult and appealing the routine, it will receive higher scores than a simple routine as long as there are no mistakes. The judging system encourages gymnasts to push their limits and strive for perfection. In the above picture, little Susan is practicing on the balance beam. She slowly places one foot in front of the other, keeping her arms spread out to help maintain her balance. If she falls, it is not far to the ground so she doesn't have to worry about getting hurt. The other girls in the class are waiting patiently in line for their turn. For now, they are just practicing walking back and forth trying not to fall off. Once they have learned to this without falling off and have gained some confidence, their teacher will teach them increasingly more difficult moves. When they have mastered the fundamentals, they may be ready to learn a choreographed routine and take part in a small competition.": "06fb05edbe56",
"This is my friend's son. His name is Brendan. Brendan is 3 years old. He has very blonde hair that is almost white. He always smiles and has very good manners. He is a good boy.": "bf21ae55b304",
"This is my friend's son. His name is Brendan. Brendan is 3 years old. He has very blonde hair that is almost white. He always smiles and has very good manners. He is a good boy. Brendan loves to go ice skating. It is his favorite thing to do in the winter. Sometimes he skates at the hockey arena, but usually he skates on a pond near his home. Before he goes out, his mother always dresses him in winter clothes. They help to keep him warm even when it is cold outside. First, she puts long underwear and an undershirt on him. Then she puts on his pants and a warm sweater. Next she puts his ski pants and a winter jacket over the other clothes. Finally, she wraps a scarf around his neck, puts a toque on his head and pulls on his mittens. He is now ready to go. The skates are put on when they get to the pond, as is the helmet. Brendan is too young to put his skates on by himself, so his father usually does it. He wears a helmet to protect his head incase he falls down. Brendan can skate for hours without stopping. His mom always sits and watches him while she drinks hot coffee and talks to the other moms. She also brings a thermos of hot chocolate along for Brendan to drink when he takes a break. When Brendan is finally cold and tired they head back home. After a day of skating, he always likes to eat a hot bowl of tomato soup to warm up. Then he often falls asleep on the couch watching cartoons. The fresh air and exercise is very good for a growing young boy.": "7cdbd350b3f2",
