"Valentine's Day is a very special day for those of you who are romantic at heart. It's a time to show that special someone just how much you really care. It can also be a time to admit your feelings to someone for the first time.": "ab115f8c1ac5",
"Valentine's Day is a very special day for those of you who are romantic at heart. It's a time to show that special someone just how much you really care. It can also be a time to admit your feelings to someone for the first time. Although some men may beg to differ, Valentine's Day is mostly for women and stores. It is the day when women want to be treated like queen or, at the very least, princesses. And remember that your queen or princess WILL be expecting something from you, so don’t forget to mark February 14th on your calendar…unless you enjoy the feeling guilty and being in the dog house. Phil is a very romantic young man. Today on his way home from school, he stopped by the local florist to pick up a bouquet of flowers for his sweetheart. Although his face doesn't show it, he cares deeply for Jill and he tells her this as he hands her the flowers. She blushes and accepts the token of his love. Surprisingly, Jill actually has feelings for the stone-faced boy. She has even picked out a gift for him, too. It is a heart-shaped box of chocolates. Phil is shocked that she cares about him. He can’t believe that the girl of his dreams likes him enough to buy him a gift. He is so overcome with joy that he begins to sob uncontrollably. Jill is quite taken aback with his crying. Perhaps her feelings are not as strong as his overwhelming adoration of her. In a panic, she drops the flowers and rushes to the door. Poor Phil can only watch as the door closes and his sweetheart exits his life forever. He drops to his knees holding his hands toward the skies. “WHY?!!” he blubbers. “WHY?!!” Five minutes later Jill is on the next bus out of town.": "52fb19e14bad",
