"When my mother was a girl, her and her family had to pump their own water for everything. If you wanted to take a drink you had to pump. If you wanted to wash your clothes, you had to pump. If you wanted to take a bath, you had to pump. Not to mention all the water they had to pump and haul by hand for the farm animals. Pump, pump, pump, all day long. Imagine having to pump water every time you turn on the tap!": "e1acc480067c",
"When people get married, there is always a lot of decorating involved. The place where the wedding is held usually gets the most attention, but even the cars that the wedding party travels around in are adorned with colorful bows, ribbons and sometimes flowers. It isn’t hard to spot a wedding procession on the street; just look for the cars that look like they are wrapped up as gifts.": "fae417b80662",
"When people get married, there is always a lot of decorating involved. The place where the wedding is held usually gets the most attention, but even the cars that the wedding party travels around in are adorned with colorful bows, ribbons and sometimes flowers. It isn’t hard to spot a wedding procession on the street; just look for the cars that look like they are wrapped up as gifts. This particular car is for the bride and groom. It has a red bow on each of the door handles, long red ribbons running overtop the hood all the way to the trunk and a heart made from plastic roses on the grill. Other cars in the procession may or may not be decorated quite as extravagantly, but they will usually have at least some decorations to show that they are involved in the wedding. In some areas of the world, it is customary for the wedding procession to drive through the streets honking the horn to garner attention. In smaller towns, people may run to the window or go outside to wave as the cars pass, but in larger centers they probably will only get an occasional glimpse if anything at all. Chances are that one day you will ride in a car decorated this, whether you are getting married or maybe just a part of the wedding party. Maybe you will get to help decorate one of the cars, too. Who knows?": "e8bb45274cb1",
